WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.820
Ben gasped as dinosaur skeletons stomped through the museum, their bones rattling.

2
00:00:09.821 --> 00:00:17.352
"N-n-nobody panic!" Mr. Freaky yelled. "Everything is totally under control!"

3
00:00:17.353 --> 00:00:21.654
"No, it's not!" Dr. Bones cried.

4
00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:29.630
A stegosaurus lumbered toward her. "What have you monsters done?"

5
00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:36.429
Ben saw a big dinosaur stomp into the Early Humans exhibit and roar at a stuffed mammoth.

6
00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:42.051
The stegosaurus was now drinking from the fountain in the lobby.

7
00:00:42.052 --> 00:00:47.820
A tall beast was munching on the plastic palm trees at the entrance to the Egyptian exhibit.

8
00:00:47.821 --> 00:00:53.672
"Help!" screamed Al Normal as the stegosaurus charged toward him.

9
00:00:53.673 --> 00:00:58.284
"Stop!" Ben commanded, floating in front of the dinosaur.

10
00:00:58.285 --> 00:01:01.241
But the stegosaurus ran right through Ben.

11
00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:02.966
Winnie jumped on her broom.

12
00:01:02.967 --> 00:01:09.934
She zoomed toward Al Normal and yanked him out of the way.

13
00:01:09.935 --> 00:01:12.529
"Waldo! Fix this!"

14
00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:18.864
"My spell book is upstairs!" Waldo moaned. "All I have is a wand."

15
00:01:18.865 --> 00:01:24.684
"Yay!" whooped a skeleton who was hanging onto the tail of the big dinosaur.

16
00:01:24.685 --> 00:01:29.569
Mr. Freaky and Dr. Bones ducked as the dinosaur ran by them.

17
00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:34.431
"Do something, Mr. Freaky!" the museum director commanded.

18
00:01:34.432 --> 00:01:45.408
Mr. Freaky blew his noses. "Students!" he bellowed. "Do something!"

19
00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:52.609
"No!" Cleo yelled at the stegosaurus as it charged toward the mummy display case. "Stay

20
00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:54.811
away from my uncle." She

21
00:01:54.812 --> 00:01:59.658
grabbed Waldo's wand and cried, "Spell, begone!" Magic

22
00:01:59.659 --> 00:02:07.130
sparks flew from the wand—and the dinosaur froze in its tracks. "Why

23
00:02:07.131 --> 00:02:10.770
didn't I think of that?" muttered Waldo. Winnie

24
00:02:10.771 --> 00:02:14.181
was still on her broom. She

25
00:02:14.182 --> 00:02:18.596
took the wand from Cleo and flew around the museum, waving it. Zap!

26
00:02:18.597 --> 00:02:27.299
Zap! Zap! Soon all the dinosaurs were lifeless bones again. Mr.

27
00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:30.284
Freaky dusted off his suit. "You

28
00:02:30.285 --> 00:02:38.415
see?" he said to Dr. Bones. "Everything is totally under control." "I

29
00:02:38.416 --> 00:02:44.285
think this is enough excitement for one day," Miss Bungle announced. She

30
00:02:44.286 --> 00:02:47.832
checked her watch. "It's nearly dinnertime. Why

31
00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:51.454
don't we return to the education wing and eat? Then

32
00:02:51.455 --> 00:02:53.977
we can settle down for the night. I'm

33
00:02:53.978 --> 00:02:58.035
sure by tomorrow everyone will feel much better." "But

34
00:02:58.036 --> 00:03:01.564
what about Uncle Tut?" Cleo protested. "They're

35
00:03:01.565 --> 00:03:03.729
keeping him prisoner!" "He's

36
00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:09.792
not a prisoner," Dr. Bones snapped, "and he's not your uncle. He's

37
00:03:09.793 --> 00:03:14.756
an exhibit. He's been with us for decades." Cleo

38
00:03:14.757 --> 00:03:20.454
folded her arms. "Well, he's been my uncle for centuries!" "We're

39
00:03:20.455 --> 00:03:24.565
not going to solve this tonight," Miss Bungle said. "Cleo,

40
00:03:24.566 --> 00:03:28.201
let's talk about this again in the morning." "That's

41
00:03:28.202 --> 00:03:32.531
a fine idea." Dr. Bones scowled. "I

42
00:03:32.532 --> 00:03:35.316
must get back to work. Now

43
00:03:35.317 --> 00:03:40.137
I have to check on the dinosaur exhibits as well." "I'm

44
00:03:40.138 --> 00:03:43.548
sorry." Waldo hung his head. "It

45
00:03:43.549 --> 00:03:47.923
was an accident," he murmured. ***

46
00:03:47.924 --> 00:03:55.084
Back in the education wing, the monsters ate dinner quietly.

47
00:03:55.085 --> 00:04:02.290
After dinner Al Normal led them to the movie theater.

48
00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:07.998
"Students, this is an absolutely thrilling documentary."

49
00:04:07.999 --> 00:04:10.731
"Goody!" yelled a goblin.

50
00:04:10.732 --> 00:04:14.481
"What's the film about?" Mog asked.

51
00:04:14.482 --> 00:04:17.211
"The history of glaciers."

52
00:04:17.212 --> 00:04:21.755
"Ugh!" All the monsters groaned.

53
00:04:21.756 --> 00:04:26.280
"That sounds so boring," Mog complained.

54
00:04:26.281 --> 00:04:30.389
"Now, students!" Mr. Freaky leaped to his feet.

55
00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:35.355
"We are guests here. Show your monster manners, please."

56
00:04:35.356 --> 00:04:38.853
The lights went out and the movie started.

57
00:04:38.854 --> 00:04:44.561
Al Normal hurried off to help Dr. Bones lock up the building for the night.

58
00:04:44.562 --> 00:04:49.125
Ben stared at the massive chunks of ice on the screen.

59
00:04:49.126 --> 00:04:51.405
They were actually kind of interesting.

60
00:04:51.406 --> 00:04:55.396
He turned toward Mog. "I never knew that—"

61
00:04:55.397 --> 00:05:07.962
Zzzz. Zzzz. Mog was already snoring.

62
00:05:07.963 --> 00:05:12.099
With a sigh, Ben turned back to the screen.

63
00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:15.865
After the movie the monsters had a snack.

64
00:05:15.866 --> 00:05:20.706
Then the kids started telling spooky people stories.

65
00:05:20.707 --> 00:05:33.544
A goblin finally burst into tears. "I'm scared! I want my mommy!"

66
00:05:33.545 --> 00:05:39.787
"Bedtime, everyone!" Mr. Freaky said, clapping his hands.

67
00:05:39.788 --> 00:05:43.806
Soon all the monsters were settled into their beds for the night. The

68
00:05:43.807 --> 00:05:46.867
girls were in one classroom with Miss Bungle. The

69
00:05:46.868 --> 00:05:51.250
boys were in another with Mr. Freaky. "Ha-ha!"

70
00:05:51.251 --> 00:05:55.308
Mog was laughing as he poked Ben. "Check

71
00:05:55.309 --> 00:06:02.821
out Mr. Freaky's pajamas!" Waldo

72
00:06:02.822 --> 00:06:05.548
climbed into his sleeping bag. "Mr.

73
00:06:05.549 --> 00:06:09.437
Freaky, what about Cleo's uncle?" he asked. "We

74
00:06:09.438 --> 00:06:11.994
can't just leave him here." "We'll

75
00:06:11.995 --> 00:06:15.832
talk about it in the morning," Mr. Freaky said. "I'm

76
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:18.950
sure the people will be reasonable." "They

77
00:06:18.951 --> 00:06:27.726
haven't been reasonable so far." Waldo sighed. "Poor Cleo." ***

78
00:06:27.727 --> 00:06:32.406
Ben was sleeping near a desert display.

79
00:06:32.407 --> 00:06:36.231
It had friendly-looking birds and snakes.

80
00:06:36.232 --> 00:06:42.167
Mr. Freaky's snores echoed through the quiet room.

81
00:06:42.168 --> 00:06:46.041
Most of the other monsters fell asleep fast too.

82
00:06:46.042 --> 00:06:49.972
But Ben kept tossing and turning.

83
00:06:49.973 --> 00:06:53.815
"So far this field trip has been a disaster," he thought.

84
00:06:53.816 --> 00:06:57.690
"No wonder people are afraid of monsters."

85
00:06:57.691 --> 00:07:03.082
Even worse, Dr. Bones was going to tell Mayor Hubbletree about the dinosaur incident.

86
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:07.500
Soon Monster Academy would be nothing but a pile of rubble.

87
00:07:07.501 --> 00:07:13.714
Just then Ben heard something moving on the other side of the room.

88
00:07:13.715 --> 00:07:17.931
A shadowy figure was creeping toward the classroom door.

89
00:07:17.932 --> 00:07:22.741
The door opened, and the figure slipped out.

